    "Codex and DeepSeek Harness keep a finished sound each, so two agents running at once can be told apart by ear. The Finished sound above covers every other provider.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex 和 DeepSeek Harness 各有自己的结束提示音，这样同时跑两个智能体时，不用看也能听出是哪一个完成了。上面那个「已完成」覆盖其余所有 provider。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
