            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ %@ · 来自 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds a compact weekly-usage ring around each chosen provider that publishes it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为每个会公布每周用量、且你选中的服务，加上一圈紧凑的每周用量圆环。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Channel": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "渠道"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NamiNotch reads usage from tools already signed in on this Mac — it never asks for your password. Install and sign in to any of Claude Code (the terminal tool, not the Claude app), Cursor (the editor or cursor-agent), Codex, Antigravity, GLM, Grok, OpenCode, Command Code, GitHub Copilot, Kimi Code, Kiro, Amp, Apify, the Kilo CLI or a Gemini API key (via Gemini CLI, OpenCode or Hermes), and its ring appears in the notch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NamiNotch 从这台 Mac 上已经登录的工具里读取用量——它从不索要密码。安装并登录以下任意一个：Claude Code（终端工具，不是 Claude 应用）、Cursor（编辑器或 cursor-agent）、Codex、Antigravity、GLM、Grok、OpenCode、Command Code、GitHub Copilot、Kimi Code、Kiro、Amp、Apify、Kilo CLI，或一个 Gemini API 密钥（经由 Gemini CLI、OpenCode 或 Hermes），它的环就会出现在刘海里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Colour transition": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "颜色过渡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Costs": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "费用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Custom Endpoints": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自定义端点"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Day starts at": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每日起始于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Days": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "天"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For every provider with a weekly limit beside a shorter one, the main ring shows the week. The shorter window moves to the thin ring and the card. Alerts, the menu bar and providers with no weekly limit are unchanged, and Claude's daily pace ring still leads when it is on.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "凡是既有每周额度、又有更短窗口的服务，主圆环显示这一周。更短的窗口挪到细圆环和卡片上。提醒、菜单栏，以及没有每周额度的服务保持不变；Claude 的每日节奏圆环打开时仍打头。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hidden from the notch · Loaded in %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已从刘海隐藏 · 载入于 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Merged into your Mac's own notch the bar is exactly as deep as the cutout, so a ring and a percentage under it have to share that depth — showing it draws the rings smaller. Turn it off for the largest rings the cutout has room for.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "与 Mac 自带刘海合并时，条带高度正好等于挖孔，因此环和它下方的百分比必须共用这点高度——显示百分比会把环画得更小。关掉它，就能得到挖孔容得下的最大环。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Name": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名称"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Name this account": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "给这个账号起名"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On this edge your notch is merged into your Mac's own cutout, and the cutout sets its size. This has no effect here — it is waiting for you to move the notch to another edge.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在这一边缘，刘海与 Mac 自带的挖孔合并，尺寸由挖孔决定。此设置在这里不生效——等你把刘海移到别的边缘才会用上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenAI-compatible APIs, local runtimes and custom proxies.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兼容 OpenAI 的 API、本地运行时和自定义代理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens System Settings when banners are off for NamiNotch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果 NamiNotch 的横幅被关掉，会打开系统设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Percentage under each ring": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个环下方的百分比"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Send a test": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发送测试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show or hide this model in the notch. It stays loaded in %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在刘海里显示或隐藏此模型。它仍会载入在 %@ 中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show weekly limit in menu bar": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在菜单栏显示每周额度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The figure under each ring. Turn it off for rings alone; the number is still a hover away in the card.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个环下方的数字。关掉后只剩环；数字仍可在卡片上悬停查看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The notch opens for a moment, with the session sound.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刘海会短暂打开，并播放会话提示音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same boundary is used everywhere a day is counted: the local model ledger, the cost log, and the DeepSeek Harness card, whose daily figures the platform cuts wherever NamiNotch asks it to.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "凡是按天计数的地方都用同一个边界：本地模型账本、花费日志，以及 DeepSeek Harness 卡片——后者的每日数据由平台按 NamiNotch 指定的位置切分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Weekly limit as the main ring": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每周额度作为主圆环"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What each project spent of each login's allowance.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个项目花掉了每个登录额度的多少。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What the notch, the menu bar and notifications call this account. Empty goes back to %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刘海、菜单栏和通知怎么称呼这个账号。留空则回到 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where to notify": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在哪里通知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which appearance the settings window is drawn in. The notch is dark by design whatever this is set to — its own Surface choice above decides how dark.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置窗口以哪种外观绘制。无论这里选什么，刘海按设计恒为深色——它的深浅由上面那个 Surface 选项决定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With the colour ramp on, this still marks critical elsewhere in the app, but the ring's own red only arrives at 100%.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启颜色渐变后，应用其他地方仍会标出危急，但圆环本身要到 100% 才变红。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Work is counted from this hour rather than from midnight, so a session that runs past it belongs to the day it was started in — a reading taken at two in the morning is about the evening that produced it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作从这一小时起算，而不是从午夜起算——这样跨过它的会话仍属于它开始的那一天，凌晨两点看到的读数是关于产生它的那个晚上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ models": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 个模型"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ plans": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 个方案"
          }
        }
