    },
    "Detected from each login once a day. A week of the plan costs the price ÷ 4.35; a project that used 4%% of the weekly allowance spent 4%% of that. Amounts in %@, your Mac's currency. Type the amount you actually pay to override the list price.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每天从各登录账号读取一次。一周的方案成本是月费 ÷ 4.35；某项目用了周额度的 4%%，就花了那一周的 4%%。金额以 %@ 计，即你这台 Mac 的货币。填写你实际支付的金额即可覆盖标价。"
