    "App designed and developed by": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用设计与开发"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect an assistant to get started": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接一个助手以开始使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NamiNotch never signs in — each reading is borrowed from the tool that already holds the account. Signing out here stops the credential being read and forgets the numbers, but leaves you signed in to that tool. macOS asks once per tool the first time, and again whenever you sign in to a different account; Always Allow keeps it quiet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NamiNotch 从不自己登录 — 每条读数都借自已经持有该账号的工具。在这里退出只会停止读取凭证并忘掉数字，你在那个工具里仍然是登录状态。macOS 每种工具第一次会问一次，换账号再登录时还会再问；选「始终允许」就不会再打扰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NamiNotch reads usage from tools already signed in on this Mac — it never asks for your password. Install and sign in to any of Claude Code (the terminal tool, not the Claude app), Cursor, Codex, Antigravity, GLM, Grok or OpenCode, and its ring appears in the notch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NamiNotch 读取这台 Mac 上已经登录的工具的用量 — 从不问你的密码。安装并登录 Claude Code（终端工具，不是 Claude 应用）、Cursor、Codex、Antigravity、GLM、Grok 或 OpenCode 中的任意一个，刘海里就会出现对应的圆环。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS will ask once for permission to read Claude Code's and Antigravity's saved logins. Choose Always Allow — plain Allow makes it ask again every time.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 会询问一次，是否允许读取 Claude Code 和 Antigravity 已保存的登录信息。请选「始终允许」— 只选「允许」的话，每次都会再问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@. Updates install in the background and apply next time NamiNotch starts.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本 %@。更新在后台安装，下次启动 NamiNotch 时生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Signed out — nothing is read, and no readings are kept.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已退出 — 不再读取，也不再保存读数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow access…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许访问…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asks macOS for %@'s saved login again. Choose Always Allow and it will stop asking.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "再次向 macOS 请求 %@ 已保存的登录信息。选「始终允许」就不会再问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch off to stop reading %@ and forget its readings. %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭后停止读取 %@ 并忘掉它的读数。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch on to sign in and read %@ again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开以重新登录并读取 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NamiNotch is not reading %@'s saved login. Choose Allow access… above and answer Allow.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NamiNotch 没有读取 %@ 保存的登录信息。请在上方选择“允许访问…”，然后选择“允许”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens %@, which is where this account is signed in.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开 %@，这个账号就是在那里登录的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens %@ in your browser. That site has its own sign-in, separate from the credential read here.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在浏览器打开 %@。那个网站有自己的登录，和这里读取的凭证不是一回事。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
