        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未选中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ (missing)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@（缺失）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Play %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "播放 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Monthly budget": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每月预算"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "None": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tokens": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "token"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ limit reached": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 额度已用尽"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is at %lld%%": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已用 %lld%%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its %@ limit is spent.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它的 %@ 额度已用完。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its %@ limit is spent — resets %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它的 %@ 额度已用完 — %@ 重置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld%% of its %@ limit used.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已用其 %2$@ 额度的 %1$lld%%。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Moves to the display containing the window receiving keyboard input.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "移到正在接收键盘输入的窗口所在的显示器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pinned to %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "固定在 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That display is disconnected. NamiNotch follows the active window until it returns.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "那台显示器已断开。NamiNotch 会跟随活动窗口，直到它回来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag to reorder. The notch draws the rings in this order.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖动以改顺序。刘海按这个顺序画圆环。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch this on to give it a ring in the notch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开后，刘海里会出现它的圆环。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alerts for %@ are muted. Click to unmute.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 的提醒已静音。点击取消静音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alert when %@ crosses 80%% and 100%% of a limit.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当 %@ 的额度越过 80%% 和 100%% 时提醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fills the ring against a ceiling you choose; Google publishes none for an API key.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按你设定的上限填充圆环；Google 不为 API 密钥公布额度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NamiNotch reads usage from tools already signed in on this Mac — it never asks for your password. Install and sign in to any of Claude Code (the terminal tool, not the Claude app), Cursor (the editor or cursor-agent), Codex, Antigravity, GLM, Grok, OpenCode, GitHub Copilot or a Gemini API key (via Gemini CLI, OpenCode or Hermes), and its ring appears in the notch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NamiNotch 读取这台 Mac 上已经登录的工具的用量 — 从不问你的密码。安装并登录 Claude Code（终端工具，不是 Claude 应用）、Cursor（编辑器或 cursor-agent）、Codex、Antigravity、GLM、Grok、OpenCode、GitHub Copilot 或 Gemini API 密钥（经由 Gemini CLI、OpenCode 或 Hermes）中的任意一个，刘海里就会出现对应的圆环。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS may ask before NamiNotch reads Claude Code's, Antigravity's or cursor-agent's saved login. Background refreshes never show that question; it appears only when you click Allow access…, and Deny stops NamiNotch reading that login until you ask again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NamiNotch 读取 Claude Code、Antigravity 或 cursor-agent 保存的登录信息前，macOS 可能会先询问。后台刷新从不弹出这个询问；只有点击“允许访问…”时才会出现，选择“拒绝”后，在你再次请求之前 NamiNotch 不会读取该登录信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reorder the rings, pick a display, and get told when a limit is close.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以重排圆环、选择显示器，额度快用尽时会通知你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag to reorder the rings": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖动以重排圆环"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings splits into Connected and Not connected; drag a connected row by its handle to change the order the notch draws them in.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置分成「已连接」和「未连接」；拖动已连接行的手柄，即可改变刘海绘制顺序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pin the notch to one display, or show it on every one": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把刘海钉在一台显示器上，或在每一台上显示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Displays picker in Appearance offers the main display or all of them; a second picker pins a single notch to a named screen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外观里的「显示器」可选主显示器或全部；第二个选择器把单个刘海钉在指定屏幕上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A ring says when it crosses 80% and 100%": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "圆环越过 80% 和 100% 时会说明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A system notification once per crossing, muted per provider from its own settings row.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次越过发一条系统通知，可在该服务自己的设置行里静音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GitHub Copilot is a new ring": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub Copilot 成了新的圆环"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reads GitHub's Copilot quota endpoint using the GitHub CLI session already on the Mac.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用这台 Mac 上已有的 GitHub CLI 会话读取 Copilot 配额接口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Say when a session ends": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会话结束时会告诉你"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The notch opens itself for a few seconds and sounds a chime when an agent stops working or starts waiting on you; a click jumps to it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "助手停止工作或开始等你时，刘海会自己打开几秒并响一声；点击会跳过去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⌥-drag the pill along its edge": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住 ⌥ 沿边缘拖动胶囊"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nudge it clear of another menu-bar app anchored to the same spot; remembered per edge.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把它挪开，避开钉在同一位置的其他菜单栏应用；按边缘记住。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose an accent colour": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择强调色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The device accent by default, or a fixed colour for the ring's positive state — the amber and red warning colours stay fixed regardless.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认用设备强调色，也可以给圆环的正常状态固定一个颜色 — 琥珀和红色警告色始终不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A countdown instead of a reset date": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用倒计时代替重置日期"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appearance's Reset time picker can show \"Resets in 3h 20m\" instead of a date and time.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外观里的「重置时间」可以显示「3 小时 20 分钟后重置」，而不是日期和时间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read Cursor from cursor-agent, and enterprise plans correctly": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以从 cursor-agent 读取 Cursor，企业套餐也能读对"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A CLI-only Cursor login now gets a ring, and enterprise/team plans read their real usage instead of reporting nothing to meter.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只用 CLI 登录的 Cursor 现在也有圆环；企业/团队套餐会读到真实用量，而不再显示没有可计量的额度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fewer keychain prompts for Claude and Antigravity": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude 和 Antigravity 的钥匙串提示更少"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude reads its own CLI's /usage first, touching the keychain only as a fallback; Antigravity's language server is asked before it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude 先读自己 CLI 的 /usage，只有退路才碰钥匙串；Antigravity 会先问它的语言服务器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sub-1% usage no longer reads as 0%": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不到 1% 的用量不再显示成 0%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A reading under one percent shows a tenth (\"<0.1%\") instead of rounding to nothing.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不到百分之一的读数会显示到十分位（「<0.1%」），而不是四舍五入成没有。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Contributors can build without Xcode signing": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "贡献者可以在没有 Xcode 签名的情况下构建"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "make build and make test sign themselves automatically when the maintainer's certificate isn't present, and CI now runs the suite on every push and pull request.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "维护者证书不在时，make build 和 make test 会自动签名；CI 现在会在每次 push 和 pull request 上跑测试套件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follow System": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跟随系统"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Matches the Mac's preferred language.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "与 Mac 的首选语言一致。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NamiNotch uses this language even if the Mac does not.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "即使 Mac 不是这种语言，NamiNotch 也使用它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Language": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "语言"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show usage pace": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示用量节奏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It spends a request every time. A provider that rate-limits answers one request too many by refusing the next few minutes of them, and the figure then ages further than it would have. Worth turning on to check NamiNotch against a provider's own dashboard, and worth turning off again after.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次都会花掉一次请求。有速率限制的服务遇到多出来的那次请求，会拒绝接下来几分钟的请求，数字反而变得更旧。适合在对照服务自己的面板时打开，对完之后再关掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pointing at a ring, or opening the menu bar menu, re-reads the limit from the provider itself rather than from a reading cached moments ago. Off, a look still asks for a live reading and accepts a cached one only while it is newer than a couple of minutes.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把指针停在某个圆环上，或打开菜单栏里的菜单，会直接向服务重新读取额度，而不是用刚刚缓存下来的读数。关闭时，一次查看同样会请求最新读数，只有几分钟以内的缓存才会被采用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask the provider every time you look": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次查看时向服务询问"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Readings": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compares each timed allowance with the time left until reset, showing quota in deficit or held in reserve.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把每段有时限的额度与距离重置的时间比较，显示透支还是留有余量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Size": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Small": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Medium": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Large": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "大"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Takes the least room on the edge. Readable, but not from across the desk.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "边缘上占得最少。能读，但隔着桌子就不行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The size the notch was drawn at.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刘海绘制时的尺寸。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Easier to read at a glance, and harder to ignore.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一眼更好读，也更难忽视。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold ⌥ and drag the notch to slide it along its edge. Each edge remembers where you left it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住 ⌥ 拖动刘海，沿边缘滑动。每条边都会记住你放的位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
